{"parse": {"title": "TSW-01", "pageid": 100954, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TSW-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/TSW-02\" title=\"TSW-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TSW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B2.89.E9.BB.98.E5.A2.93.E7.A2.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"沉默墓碑\">沉默墓碑</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 沉默墓碑</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Silent Grave</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>深<span class=\"color-value\"></span>深<span class=\"color-value\"></span>处<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192301</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_haitan1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_haitan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_haitan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁静的岸边，海浪一如既往地拍打环礁，吞吐着洁净的白沙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落日时分，海岛住民的木制房屋升起炊烟，连同挂在高处的罗盘灼灼，一齐指引着归处方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>图图石子，和我再最后检查一遍那些独木舟，别让托阿明天比赛的时候翻到海里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>托阿兴奋了好多天～就算他掉到海里去，我想也不是独木舟的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>而且，哥哥你会去把他捞起来的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>那小子……他游得可比你哥哥要快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>独木舟整齐地排列在沙滩上，它们磨损旧化程度不一，不同的努库泰澳人为它们涂抹了图案与色彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像一群奇异的、沉默的墓碑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们很久没有做新的独木舟了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>是啊，这些旧的独木舟，已经足够我们所有努库泰澳的年轻人坐上。先划到以提提，再绕到米缇和维布那，最后回到麦黎……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>你还没算上我呢，等到明年，我也可以划独木舟了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到妹妹似是抱怨，又隐含期待的话，哥哥在海岛的晚风中沉默了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>图图石子，等到明年……明年的独木舟环岛比赛，我给你打一艘新船，好不好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>我们去找一棵树干最直的树，把船头的弧度修得漂亮，到时候你可以借着风和海浪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>哥哥……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>我们图图石子会有一艘新的独木舟，你划得很快，谁也追不上你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兄长热忱的话语描绘着充满光辉的新船，无声的巨浪却已经在他身后高高竖起，像一块黑色的幕布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那意味着故事已经落幕了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡穆塔：</div><div>图图……石子……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_haitan2\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_haitan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_haitan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>哥哥……托阿……你们在哪儿？你们去哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>等等我！我马上就来找你们！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_haimian\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_haimian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Cg-2_4_bg_haishang.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Cg-2 4 bg haishang.png\">2_4_bg_haishang</a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海浪沉浮，女孩单薄的呼喊声在茫茫海面上孤独地回荡着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海水的包裹一如既往的熟悉，图图石子深知它将要带着自己抵达何方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我要回家……我离开家太久了……哥哥……托阿……你们都走了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子在大海之中漂流，竭力眺望，海洋与天空的交界线没有任何起伏，亦没有任何休止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小岛沉没了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_yanmo\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_yanmo\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_yanmo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>不见了……没有了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>没有了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>米缇，维布那，麦黎……我们的岛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我不应该走的，我不应该离开的，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shuixiamaopao\"><img alt=\"shuixiamaopao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/600px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/900px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/1200px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Cg-2_4_bg_haishang.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Cg-2 4 bg haishang.png\">2_4_bg_haishang</a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>问题在浪潮之中被碾碎，如同水滴落入汪洋之中，没有回响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>图图石子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>醒醒，醒醒！图图石子！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-310911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>塞洛尼……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-310916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>哥哥……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识到这就是现实，图图石子立刻紧闭上嘴唇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>一个不太好的梦，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停顿片刻，图图石子点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞洛尼捧起自己的贝壳项链，将其中一颗贝壳放在图图石子的额前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子闭上眼睛，同样拿起自己的贝壳项链，按在塞洛尼额前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>吞没在浪潮之中，吹散在海风之中，消弭在迷雾之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>海妖之歌，勿使我迷失航向；梦魇之声，勿使我忘却归路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>贝壳的告诫警醒我，贝壳的纹路指引我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我将归来，我已归来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>这首歌还是你教我唱的呢，还记得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>友人温暖的面庞让图图石子从可怕的梦魇中抽离，逐渐归于平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>你和托阿偷偷出海，遇到暴风雨的那一天，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>那一天我想去以提提采罗盘草，我的罗盘灼灼就差最后一株了。我没有听从贝壳的指引，怂恿托阿带我去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>我们的小船离岸只有那么短的距离，却差点被风吹到海里去，托阿拼命地划桨，手里还紧紧地攥着罗盘草……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>当时哥哥差点急哭了。幸好你们还是回来了，你和托阿被骂了一顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>那段时间我一直很害怕，怕靠岸只是一场梦，怕托阿其实已经被浪卷走了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>于是你给我唱了这首歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>我将归来，我已归来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>塞洛尼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>你最近好吗？我是说，来到这里之后，我们不像以前那样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>生活在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个很难回答的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个一同离开了家乡的朋友，在给予对方陪伴之前，却先察觉到自己的渺小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻过后，塞洛尼的泪水落到图图石子的手臂上，滚烫，随即失去温度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子紧紧地抱住了她。她们的贝壳项链碰撞着，发出轻微声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>对不起，图图石子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>这里很好，我学会写他们的文字了，我去了图书馆，知道了很多“外面的”事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>外面的世界和我们想象的完全不一样。我们以前那么笃信我们的想象，所以从来没想过要去了解它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>因为我们从来没想过要离开……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>即使我们知道最后会发生什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞洛尼：</div><div>……我很想念托阿，想念卡穆塔，想念我们的岛、我们的家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朋友的眼泪像小溪，顺着图图石子的皮肤蜿蜒而下，引得她的心阵阵刺痛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仍然轻拍她的背，希望缓解这突如其来又避无可避的悲伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>你还有我，塞洛尼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我也还有你，我们不会再走散了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>哥哥，托阿，他们也去往归处了，他们的灵魂在海深深处平息，永远不再迷失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>他们会保佑我们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是真的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还是暂且只想平息友人的泪水与痛苦，在自己也要被悲伤淹没之前，慌乱地舔舐彼此的伤口？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……只要我们在，我们的家、我们的岛永远都在。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助手的脚步轻轻停住，手中的纸质申请书有着笔迹稚拙的签名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，图图石子小姐提出申请，她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>她想要能够赐予安眠的神秘术——或是一份药物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>药物？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>图图石子小姐她……她为梦魇所扰，但申请书上并没有写上具体的梦境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>除了申请书，图图石子还说了什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>她来得很匆忙，只递了申请书，又很快走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>——图图石子小姐的申请书写得很规整，非常符合规范，很少人能做到她这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圣洛夫基金会的表格繁琐，手续冗杂，流程漫长，人尽皆知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我会尽快为箱内成员的表格与手续申请调整，不是每个人都需要适应这样的流程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>图图石子想要消除一些她不愿回想的梦境，比起神秘术或药物，我想会有更好的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>只是我们需要一些时间。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-01"}}